      "text": "encircles Lamanites with his army, Alma 43:35. pursues Lamanite army, Alma 43:36–53. is appointed chief captain over city of Noah, Alma 49:16–17. assists Moroni1 in defeating Lamanites, Alma 52:27–36 (62:32–34). is given command of city of Mulek, Alma 53:2. is left in charge of men and provisions, Alma 61:15–21 (62:3, 13). laments Teancum’s death, Alma 62:37. assists Moronihah1, Hel. 1:28.",
